# {{name}}

A React + UI Bridge app scaffolded by Qontinui, with a compiled design language.

## Development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Spec-driven development

Specs live in `specs/pages/<id>/`. Author states with `<State>` and
transitions with `<TransitionTo>` from `@qontinui/ui-bridge`; the
`uiBridgeIRPlugin` in `vite.config.ts` compiles those annotations into
`src/state-machine.derived.json` on every build.

## Design

`design/language.dtcg.json` is the visual system. `npm run design:compile`
compiles it into `src/design/` and regenerates `specimen.html` and the
component index in `CLAUDE.md`; `npm run build` fails when they drift. Open
`specimen.html` (or `npm run preview` and `/specimen.html`) to see every
component in every state. Identity values (colour, typeface) start
`undeclared` and render as the browser's own system values until you declare
them in the source file.
